/* =========================
   31. TRANSACTION SAVEPOINT
   =========================
   DEF: Mark a point in transaction to rollback partially
   WHEN: Complex transactions
   WHERE: Banking, e-commerce
   INPUT:
   START TRANSACTION;
   SAVEPOINT sp1;
   UPDATE student SET city='Agra' WHERE id=1;
   ROLLBACK TO sp1;
   COMMIT;
   OUTPUT: Partial rollback done
   REAL: Rollback only last step in money transfer
*/

